  m_Name: Voyage - the sea moves her
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.VisualScripting.Flow::Unity.VisualScripting.ScriptGraphAsset
  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Voyage - the sea moves her","summary":"Wind and tide carry her besides her own way (Code/Game/Voyage/Adrift.cs, SeaPush.cs, RoughWaters.cs; Data/sea_push.json, rough_waters_793.json). When that does something she should know of, it comes here: the log says it, and the clock drops back where the moment calls for it. How much the sea moves her is the rule graphs'' (Game/Graphs/Rules: her leeway, blown downwind, a lee shore, the rough waters ...).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"abed7b5a-6434-4396-ad9b-8c79c0105a2b","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheSeaMovesHer","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{"words":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":460.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"49b45f0e-3fd3-4a4f-bf95-65694bd1a144","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LogSay","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":860.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"c1bf65a1-b46b-4175-ad16-b44e94ef127d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{"why":{"$content":"Pressing","$type":"Kapman.Game.ClockReason"}},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"aa568956-6776-43b6-a565-6b2a1fe1fb6c","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.ClockDropBack","$id":"15"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"075d93f5-d00a-41c7-889f-1b05e20aa804","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"bcdb7952-f10a-4bf8-b3ee-393b523c6767","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"0d05c1f7-6fab-407d-9caf-8b85892a8661","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"words","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"words","guid":"27441aee-c591-48cd-9d2a-e80bd8b9dc69","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"drops","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"condition","guid":"9694c998-b9dc-418b-9eb9-d0e208570d08","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"why","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"why","guid":"8bb97f0d-07c2-46e9-b327-7e554825d7d9","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-90.0,"xMax":2060.0,"yMax":330.0},"label":"The sea moves her","comment":"Five moments: she is set well off her line; she is held off a lee shore; lying to in deep water, she is carried; the steersman has lost his reckoning; she comes into rough water.","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"9037e96b-cb26-4e59-aa3b-2bfc83c0006a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":540.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The moments","body":"off_line: wind and tide have set her well off her line (the table''s offLineWarnM).\nlee_shore: she is set down on a shore she has not the way on to keep clear of.\nadrift: lying to in water too deep to anchor in, she goes where wind and tide carry her.\nlost: the steersman has run his distance and cannot make out his landfall; she lies to.\nrough: she comes into rough water (a race, a bar, a shoal, an open cape).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"4b631fb6-ab90-402b-aa07-792a902f1630","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":580.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1140.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The words, and the clock","body":"The words come with the event (\"Wind and tide have set her 9 km to the north-east of her line.\"): PLACEHOLDER WORDS, in Adrift.cs and RoughWaters.cs, the user''s to write. The clock drops back for all but ''adrift''; each reason has its own switch in the settings. To treat one moment otherwise, put a Switch on ''What'' after the event.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"c2b86004-91b5-4db2-b287-2643a82aee99","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1180.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1740.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"What is not here","body":"What moves her and how much: the tide''s stream (a model of the real tides), her leeway, the wind''s drift, the steersman''s reckoning, keeping her off the land. Their numbers are rule graphs (Game/Graphs/Rules) and the table (Game/Data/sea_push.json); the rest is the code''s (Adrift.Carry, SeaPush).","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"b270204c-9364-49bc-9eab-928caea02434","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
